  "content": "<h1>鞘翅装饰扩展</h1>\n<p><em>默认的装饰不够用？或者你喜欢的模组添加了更多装饰，却没有为鞘翅提供支持？\nElytra Trims Extensions 为你解决这一问题！</em></p>\n<h1><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.kikugie.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 邀请链接</a>（专为 CurseForge 用户提供，因为它 <em>仍然</em> 无法正确处理 Markdown）</h1>\n<h1>安装方法</h1>\n<p>在你的客户端安装主模组（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252felytra-trims\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elytra Trims</a>）。额外的装饰将会自动添加。</p>\n<h1>支持的模组</h1>\n<h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-armor-trims\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Armor Trims</a> (Fabric)</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5edtQ4at/images/a14a4a8064a83654e28aa4fe363154df7bf6c5d5.png\" alt=\"MAT #1\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5edtQ4at/images/9e5e1ecde0fa793bf9b79d7babe8849d0052e0d1.png\" alt=\"MAT #2\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5edtQ4at/images/1ea603724a77fa24b0b12c45d1703b1382da9b9b.png\" alt=\"MAT #3\"></p>\n<h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fancient-aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ancient Aether</a> (Forge)</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5edtQ4at/images/28a1dfedb6c8de817db8dd33807d5ddc3a4d661f.png\" alt=\"AA #1\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5edtQ4at/images/83d1eedaf6d66d514b570bab0423fb5bc248e156.png\" alt=\"AA #2\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5edtQ4at/images/aa7ea20d9a5f544069cd1cab113d2ab10b0e1716.png\" alt=\"AA #3\"></p>\n<h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgeode-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geode+</a> (Fabric &amp; Forge)</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5edtQ4at/images/ebf229dc9ad8252384e5c12864500510c3e67d95.png\" alt=\"Geode+\"></p>\n<h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffrostiful\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Frostiful</a> (Fabric)</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5edtQ4at/images/36eec29b7e833b958fb31099db8871a305fe68d8.png\" alt=\"Frostiful\"></p>\n<h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252falexs-caves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Caves</a> (Forge)</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5edtQ4at/images/14fe7e56d92683cd77f9f5401db8894698b1d444.png\" alt=\"AC\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-sniffer-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Sniffer Flowers</a> (Forge)</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/5edtQ4at/images/b673ff8837f5cd36b8988acf0fb8f8798cf937fc.png\" alt=\"MSF\"></p>\n<h1>支持本模组</h1>\n<p>如果你知道其他添加装饰图案的模组或数据包，欢迎通过提交 GitHub Issue 或在 Discord 服务器上发送消息给我！</p>",
